Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住 别松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Hold on. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在帮你调整一下姿势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay Now let's worry about how you get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚挪过来点 脚尖朝这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come a little forward here, Point your toe this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过来一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hips, here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看得见吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you see? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那这样呢 还看得见吗 - 看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about now? can you see now? - No…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 拉弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球 小屁孩 接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice throw, kiddo! here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想加蛋黄酱还是芥末酱 还是都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys want mayo or mustard, or both?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁吃热狗加蛋黄酱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants mayo on a hotdog?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你的弟弟们想要呢 两个芥末酱的 谢啦 孩儿他妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon your brothers. Two mustards, please! thanks, momma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特 蛋黄还是芥末\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate, mayo or mustard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想要番茄酱 - 没问题 我们也带了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want ketchup. - Ketchup? We get ketchup too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意肘部位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your elbow…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮 小鹰眼 去拔箭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job, hawkeye! go get your arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 练得差不多啦 汤出锅咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Enough practice. Soup's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 来啦 我们也饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We're coming. We're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱拉 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lila, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lila?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.10,0:01:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.25,0:02:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持这个姿势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're just holding the position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就差一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,进了 打平\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a goal. We're now one a-piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,平局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到紧张了没 这才是乐趣所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the tension? It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 现在你有机会赢我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was terrible. Now you have a chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了 恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you won. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,公平比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,友好运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,波兹小姐 佩珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, miss potts… Pep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看到了这段录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you find this recording…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别发到网上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't post it, on social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺伤感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a rt to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你能不能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you're ever gonna see these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都不知道你是不是还…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know if you're still…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你还在吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. I hope so…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是第21… 22天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is day 21… Uh, 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是这浩瀚宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if it wasn't for the existensial terror of…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我自觉有些微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staring into the literal void of space,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天过得还挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say, I'm feeling more better today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了小蓝妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infection's run its course,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染的地方已经好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to the blue…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定会喜欢她 特别干练\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd love her. Very practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是下手有点重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a tiny bit sadistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,部分燃料仓在作战时炸裂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some fuel cells were cracked during battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们找到一种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we figured out a way…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用反向离子充电 争取了48个小时的飞行时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}To reverse the ion charge by ourselves, about, 48 hours of flight time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在没招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's now dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我们最近的补给站还有1000多光年呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're 1, 000 lightyears from the nearest 7-11.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,氧气明早就耗尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen will run out tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that'll be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩珀 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pep, i…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经说过不会再有意外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I said no more surprises, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我真的希望能完成这最后一次任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta say, I was really hoping to pull off one last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it looks like…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必你也知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为此而难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't feel bad about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你可以悲痛几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean actually if you grovel for a couple weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带着对我的想念继续生活下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, move on with enormous guilt…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得躺下了 放松一下眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should probably lie down. I'm gonna caress my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please know…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡着的时候 就像最近发生的一切一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I drift off, it will be like everything lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,都挺好的 我一切都挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine… Totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会梦到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll dream about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦里一直都是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's always you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没能阻止得了他 - 我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Couldn't stop him. - Neither could I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去那孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 我们都失去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸来到地球 已经23天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been 23 days since Thanos came to earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,各国政府分崩离析\N{\fnArial\fs30}World governments are in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在运转的部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parts that are still working…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在做人口统计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or trying to take a senses…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前看来他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looks like he did…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的话都做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did exactly what he said he was…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸夺去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thano wiped out…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty percent of all living creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now? where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.23,0:10:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就打开了一扇传送门然后走了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just opened a portal and walked through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得自己失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks he failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然事实如此 不过我们在座的各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which of course he did, but you know there's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位不是失败者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of that goin' ad? I need to shav…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 你说话之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, at this exact second,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都以为你是毛绒玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were teddybear..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追踪灭霸三周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been hunting Thanos for three weeks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星扫描宇宙都一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep space scans, and satellites, and we got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尼 你跟他交过手 - 谁跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tony you fought him. - Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是跟他打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他直接把一颗星球砸在我脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He wiped my face with a planet while a…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那个玩魔法的就把宝石交给他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bleecker street magician gave away the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 根本就没打\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happened. There was no fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有留下什么线索 坐标什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he give you any clues? Any coordinates, anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几年前就知道这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw this coming a few years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就料到了 只不过一直不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a vision. I just couldn't believe it…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:10:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为是一场噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I was dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尼 我需要你专心 - 我曾经也需要过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tony I'm gonna need you to focus. - And I needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是过去时了 我当时比你现在更需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in, past tense. That trumps what…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都晚了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need. It's too late, buddy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我现在需要什么吗 我就需要刮个胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I need? I need to shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我记得我以前就说过 - 托尼 托尼 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I believe I rememeber telling, - Tony, tony, tony…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why that otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要的是 用战甲把\N{\fnArial\fs30}That what we needed, was a suit of…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界武装起来 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armor around the world, remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管它是不是侵犯了我们宝贵的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether it impacted our precious freedoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我们需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not. That's what we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那条路也行不通 不是吗 - 我说我们会输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well that didn't work out, did it? - I said we'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 即使输了也一起面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said, "we'll do that together, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在好了 队长 我们输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well guess what, cap? we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你当时根本就不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们不一直是这样吗 事后诸葛亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's what we do, right? our best work after the fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是复仇者 只能是复仇者吗 就不能当预防者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the avengers? We're the avengers? not the prevengers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们都听懂了 坐下吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You made your point. Just sit down, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 我的意思是… - 她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no. Here's my poi… - She's great,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 顺便夸一下 - 托尼 先坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By the way. - Tony, just sit down…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要你 你是新生力量 - 你们这群老倔驴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need you. You're new blood. - Bunch of tired old mules…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都给不了你 队长 没有坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing for you, cap. I got no coordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有线索 没有战术 没有方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clues, no strategies, no options…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有 没有信任可言了 你个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero. Zip. Nada. No trust, you liar…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 找到他以后穿上战甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take this. You find him and you put that on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尼 - 我没事 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tony! - I'm fine. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯给了他一针镇静剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce gave him a sedative. He's gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今天可能就醒不过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably be out for the rest of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们照顾好他 我回来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys take care of him. and I'll bring…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他带一瓶佐立安灵药\N{\fnArial\fs30}An bezurian elixir when I come back…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪 - 杀灭霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - To kill thanos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一般都是团队作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we usually work as a team here, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们现在还有点摩擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between you and I we're also a little fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道太空可能是你的领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}We realize up there is more your…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这也是我们的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Territory but this's our fight too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道他在哪吗 - 我知道谁也许会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You even know where he is? - I know people who might.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必折腾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你们灭霸在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you where thanos is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸用了很长时间让我变得完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos spent a long time trying to perfect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教导我时 说了他的宏伟计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he worked, he talked about his great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时即使我被大卸八块 也想让他开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even disassembled, I wanted to please him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会问他 当我们大功告成时 我们将何去何从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd ask, where would we go once his plan was complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的答案永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}His answer was always the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那个花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.19,0:13:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思 灭霸居然也想要采菊东篱下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cute. Thanos has a retirement plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸打了响指以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When thanos snapped his fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球变成了一个毁灭性能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth became ground zero for a power surge…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆发的爆心投影点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of ridiculously coson of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没人见过那么大的能量 直到两天以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever seen anything like it… Until two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这颗星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又一次使用了宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used the stones again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在人手不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be going in short-handed, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且宝石还在他手上 - 那我们就抢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, he still got the stones, so… - So let's get'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后用宝石让所有人复活 - 就这么简单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We use them to bring everyone back. - Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使成功的机率再小 我们也不得不放手一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if there's a small chance that we can undo this…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了逝去的战友 一切都是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we owe it to everyone who's not in this room to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们这样做的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do this, how do we know it's gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道结果会和上次不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}End any differently as it did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为上次 你们没有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because before, you didn't have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 姑娘 现在这间屋子里的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, new girl, everybody in this…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room is about that super hero life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冒昧地问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you don't mind my asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前那么长时间你都去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell have you been all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在宇宙中还有许多星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a lot of other planets in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些星球上甚至没有像你们一样的超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unfortunately, they didn't have you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去干掉这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get this son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:59.62,Title,0,0,0,0,,《复仇者联盟4：终局之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 有谁没上过太空 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Who here hasn't been to space? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好不要吐在我的飞船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better not throw up on my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备跃迁 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approaching jump in 3.. 2.. 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去侦查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll head down for recon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们一定会成功的 史蒂夫 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is gonna work, steve. - I know it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.41,0:16:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为除了成功 我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't know what I'm gonna do if it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有卫星 没有飞船 没有军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}No satellites, no ships, no armies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有地面防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}No ground defenses…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙需要被改善\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe required correction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之后 宝石除了诱惑 已别无他用\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, the stones served no purpose, beyond temptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀害了数万亿生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murdered trillions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.87,0:18:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该感激我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝石在哪里 - 消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are the stones? - Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 化为了灰烬 - 你两天前还用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reduced to atoms. - You used them two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用宝石的力量毁掉了宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used the stones to destroy the stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点让我送了性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It nearly killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是任务还是圆满完成了 注定如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the work is done. It always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 就是公理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这个地方翻个底朝天 他一定在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tear this place apart. He has to be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲什么事都可能做\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father is many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯独不会说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}A liar is not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 宝贝女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我以前对你太严厉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I treated you too harshly…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我是冲着他的脑袋去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went for the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:11.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（五年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So i, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（他们不在了 我们何去何从）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找了个时间 约人吃了顿饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went on a date the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年来这还是头一遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first time in five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 坐在餐桌旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? sit down to dinner…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然不知道该说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们聊了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.11,0:20:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是老套的梗 怎么时过境迁的 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old crap, you know? how things have changed, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作 他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job, his job….
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我们有多怀念纽约大都会球队\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much we miss the mets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:20:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们都无话可说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then things get quiet..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上沙拉的时候 他哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cried as they were serving the salads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.67,0:21:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上甜点的时候 我也哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cried just before dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是明天我和他还会见面 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm seeing him again tomorrow, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经度过了最艰难的时刻 你迈出了关键的第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the hardest part. You took the jump, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不知道接下来会面对什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know where you were gonna come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 虽然是很小的一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it. That's those little,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,千里之行 始于足下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave baby stepse that he left..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们重新团结起来 找到目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}To try and become whole again. To try and find purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,1945年 我被封在冰里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went in the ice in '45 right…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 我刚遇到我的一生挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I met the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.91,0:21:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来已是70年以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woke up 70 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不得不面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界的命运掌握在我们手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's left to us guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.91,0:22:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不肩负起使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we got to do something with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸本来可以把我们都杀掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos should've killed all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.06,0:22:14.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.08,0:22:22.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（私人仓库）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.27,0:23:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:35.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（救命）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.67,0:23:48.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寻人启事）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.59,0:23:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 嘿 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid! hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.48,0:24:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.14,0:24:28.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（逝者）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.99,0:24:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 拜托 拜托 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please. Please, please. No, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.37,0:24:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一下 不好意思 不 凯茜 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Sorry. No, cassie, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.89,0:24:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.68,0:25:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please, please….
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.35,0:25:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要有凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, cassie…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.56,0:25:08.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯科特·朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.77,0:25:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.41,0:25:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.76,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都长这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.30,0:26:17.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁止入内）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.44,0:26:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们登上了丹佛斯发现的那艘可疑的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we boarded that highly suspect warship danvers pinged.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.08,0:26:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是破烂不堪的垃圾船\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an infectious garbage scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.01,0:26:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢你这个情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thanks for the hot tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.71,0:26:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当时你们离飞船更近吧 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you were closer. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.32,0:26:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们身上还有一股垃圾味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we smell like garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.65,0:26:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们注意到那些震颤声了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a reading on those tremors?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.27,0:26:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是非洲板块的地壳运动而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mild subduction under the african plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.02,0:26:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有影像吗 怎么处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a visual? how are we handling it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.14,0:26:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 只是海底地震而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat, it's an earthquake under the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.76,0:26:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不处理就是最正确的处理方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We handle it by not handling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.51,0:26:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔 下个月你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, are we seeing you here next month?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恐怕不在 - 为什么 又要换新发型吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not likely. - What, you gonna get another haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:27:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 毛脸儿 还有很多事等着我去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, fur-face. I'm covering a lot of territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.56,0:27:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和地球一样处于险境的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things that are happening on earth are…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,比比皆是 成百上亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happening everywhere, on thousands of planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.58,0:27:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个解释不错 你说的都对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good point. That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.66,0:27:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们可能会有很长一段时间见不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you might not see me for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.62,0:27:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Uh, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.18,0:27:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个频道会一直开着 所以如果出了什么意外的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This channel is always active. So, anything goes sideways…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.67,0:27:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者有人找麻烦的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone's making trouble where they shouldn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.45,0:27:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得找我 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Comes through me. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.10,0:27:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.20,0:27:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.12,0:27:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪儿 - 墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you? - Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.30,0:27:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦部队发现了一个屋子 里面全是尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The federales found a room full of bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.35,0:27:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像一群黑帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a bunch of cartel guys. Never…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没来得及开枪还手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even had the chance to take their guns…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说不定是黑吃黑 - 绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's probably a rival gang… - Except it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.59,0:27:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是巴顿干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's definitely barton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.17,0:27:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的所作所为 还有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he's done here, what he's…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.62,0:27:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去几年的行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been doing for the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.03,0:27:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他造成的那些影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the scene that he left…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.74,0:28:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 有些时候我真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you, there's a part of…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不想去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me that doesn't even want to find him…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能查出他接下来会去哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you find out where he's going next?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.08,0:28:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.88,0:28:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.42,0:28:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.42,0:28:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想给你做顿晚饭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'd offer to cook you dinner…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.73,0:28:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是看来你情绪非常糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you seem pretty miserable already.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.30,0:28:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来洗衣服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here to do your laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.70,0:28:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便来看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to see a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.37,0:28:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, your friend is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.87,0:28:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天过桥的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I saw a pod of whales…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.26,0:28:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了一群鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I came across a bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.50,0:28:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是哈德逊河吗 - 船很少 水很清澈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the hudson? - There's fewer ships, cleaner water.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.58,0:28:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要鼓励我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you're about to tell…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.20,0:28:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,积极乐观地面对生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me to look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.03,0:29:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.27,0:29:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to hit you in the head…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.68,0:29:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,砸你脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a peanut sandwich…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.74,0:29:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我老毛病又犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Force of habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在告诉所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I keep telling everybody…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.95,0:29:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要学会放下过去 学会成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should move on, grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.81,0:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.60,0:29:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.94,0:29:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我放过自己 谁来替我做这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I move on, who does this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许根本没必要做这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it doesn't need being done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.69,0:29:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.05,0:29:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如今我拥有了现在的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.08,0:29:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.28,0:29:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个大家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}This family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.70,0:30:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was… I was better because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even though…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.49,0:30:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.28,0:30:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是想让自己变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm still trying to be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.06,0:30:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们俩都应该重新开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we both need to get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.92,0:30:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.32,0:30:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Hi. Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.24,0:30:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗 我是斯科特·朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone home? this is scott lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.29,0:30:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几年前见过 在德国的机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met a few years ago, at the airport? in germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.67,0:30:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变得非常非常大 还戴了个面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got really big and I had my mask on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.58,0:30:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们可能认不出我来 - 这是以前的录像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wouldn't recognize me. - Is this an old message?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.11,0:30:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蚁人记得吗 蚁人 我知道你们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ant-man? ant-man, I know you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.30,0:30:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个大门口的监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the front gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.54,0:30:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要跟你们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.09,0:31:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.41,0:31:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有谁学过量子物理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have either of you guys ever studied quantum physics?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.06,0:31:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in mid-conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.44,0:31:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.53,0:31:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前 就在灭霸那事之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years ago, right before… Thanos,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.43,0:31:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我在一个叫量子领域的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a place called the quantum realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.70,0:31:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子领域就像是一个独立的微观宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quantum realm is like its own microscopic universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.51,0:31:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要进去 就得变得\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get in there, you have to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常非常小 霍普是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibly small. Hope…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.21,0:31:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是 她曾经是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… She was my…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.04,0:31:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本应该把我从量子领域拉出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was supposed to pull me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.87,0:31:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是灭霸出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Thanos happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.67,0:31:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就被困住了 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got stuck in there. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.45,0:31:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这五年你一定很漫长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must've been very long five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.74,0:31:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我想说的 并不漫长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that's just it. It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.76,0:31:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 只是五个小时而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me it was five hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.19,0:31:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗 量子领域的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the rules of the quantum realm…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.59,0:31:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和宏观世界的不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't like they are appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.84,0:31:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都无法预测 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is unpredictable. Is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的三明治啊 我快饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody's sandwich? I am starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.58,0:31:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.81,0:31:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.04,0:32:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.78,0:32:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子领域的时间运行和现实世界不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time works differently in the quantum realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.32,0:32:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在唯一的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only problem is right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.17,0:32:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道怎么操控它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a way to navigate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.94,0:32:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们找到方法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.38,0:32:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我止不住地想 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop thinking about it. What…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.81,0:32:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能操控这种无序性\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could somehow control the chaos…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.13,0:32:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,使它为我们所用呢 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we could navigate it? what if…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.78,0:32:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能在一个特定的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a way to enter…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.82,0:32:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入量子领域 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quantum realm at a certain point in time but then…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.21,0:32:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,再从另外一个时间点离开量子领域呢 比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exit the quantum realm at another point in time? like…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.84,0:32:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如灭霸到来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like before Thanos.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.29,0:32:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在说时间机器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, are you talking about a time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.81,0:32:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 当然不是 不是时间机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, of course not. No, not a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.87,0:32:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.98,0:32:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就是时间机器 我知道这很疯狂 很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like a time machine. I know. It's crazy. It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.52,0:32:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直在想 肯定有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't stop thinking about it. There's gotta be…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.01,0:32:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 某种方法…是太疯狂了 - 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some wa… It's crazy. - Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.02,0:32:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能收到浣熊发来的邮件呢 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get e-mails from a raccoon. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.25,0:32:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事称得上是疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing sounds crazy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.65,0:32:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要和谁商量这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who do we talk to about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.77,0:33:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭饭啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chow-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.21,0:33:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgoona.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.74,0:33:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根·史塔克 想不想吃午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan h. Stark. Want some lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.17,0:33:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说 午饭吃什么 不然我就消灭你 - 好好好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Define lunch or be disintegrated. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.07,0:33:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该穿这个的 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not be wearing that, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.39,0:33:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我给妈妈准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is part of a special anniversary…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,周年礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gift made for mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.41,0:33:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下来吧 你午饭想吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. are you thinking about lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.51,0:33:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,生菜卷蟋蟀可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want a handful of crickets in a bit of lettuce?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.03,0:33:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 你不想试试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - That's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.48,0:33:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么找到这个的 - 在车库里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you find this? - Garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.82,0:33:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你特意去找的吗 - 不是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were you looking for it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.64,0:33:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是无意中找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢去车库玩吗 爸爸也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like going to the garage, huh? so does daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.76,0:33:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没关系 反正妈妈也不会戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine actually. Mom never wears anything I buy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.97,0:34:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道这听起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we know what it sounds like…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.54,0:34:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 经历了这么多之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, after everything you've seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.92,0:34:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么是不可能的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anything really…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.72,0:34:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子波动会扰乱普朗克尺度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quantum fluctuation messes with the planck scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.17,0:34:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,继而引发德意志命题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which then triggers the Deutsch Proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.94,0:34:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we agree with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.41,0:34:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.33,0:34:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的说就是 你们回不来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In layman's terms, it means you're not coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.94,0:34:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我回来了啊 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.16,0:34:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是碰巧活下来了 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You accidentally survived. It's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.55,0:34:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是十亿分之一的概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a billion-to-one cosmic fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你还想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you wanna pull a…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.78,0:34:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才怎么说来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.01,0:34:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时空抢劫 - 对 时空抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A time heist? - Yeah. Time heist.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.92,0:34:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对哦 我们之前怎么没想到这个方法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Why didn't we think of this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.74,0:34:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了 因为这个方法太可笑了 就是白日做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! because it's laughable? because it's a pipedream?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.55,0:34:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去有宝石 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stones are in the past. We…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.73,0:34:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以回到过去 拿到宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can go back and…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们自己打响指 把大家都带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can snap our own fingers. We can bring everybody back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.44,0:34:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者把现实弄得更糟糕 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or screw it up worse than he already has, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.61,0:35:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会搞砸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe we would.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.09,0:35:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说 我还挺怀念这种盲目乐观的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta say this. Sometimes, I miss that giddy optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.47,0:35:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 如果我们没有一个安全可行的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, high hopes won't help if there's no logical,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.65,0:35:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来进行这个所谓的时空抢劫 期望再高也没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tangible, way for me to safely execute said time heist.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.26,0:35:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得最可能的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the most likely outcome…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们全军覆没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will be our colecond chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.12,0:35:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们严格遵循时间旅行的规则 肯定不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we strictly follow the rules of time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.23,0:35:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跟过去的自己说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means no talking to our past selves,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.02,0:35:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不买体育彩票\N{\fnArial\fs30}No betting on sports events.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.34,0:35:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打断一下 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stop you right there, scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.84,0:35:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要告诉我 你拯救宇宙的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seriously telling me that your plan to…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.46,0:35:30.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,是看《回到未来》想出来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the universe is based on back to the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.56,0:35:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是啊 - 那就好 吓我一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Good. You had me worried there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那部电影是瞎编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that'd be horseshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,量子物理不是这么用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how quantum physics works?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.13,0:35:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.31,0:35:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得坚定立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to take a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.44,0:35:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坚定过啊 但结果就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did stand. and yet, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.64,0:35:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你现在有很多顾虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you got a lot on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.49,0:35:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有妻有女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a wife, a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.19,0:35:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我失去了对我很重要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I lost someone very important…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.85,0:35:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多人和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me. a lot of people did…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.62,0:35:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 现在我们有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, now, we have a chance to bring…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.25,0:36:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她 把所有人带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her back, to bring everyone back…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.02,0:36:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却告诉我你连试都不愿意试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're telling me that you won't even…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.43,0:36:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 斯科特 我不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, scott. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.39,0:36:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.67,0:36:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈叫我来救你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy told me to come and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.99,0:36:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job. I'm saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.31,0:36:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很希望你们今天不是为了这件事来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you'd come here to ask me something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.29,0:36:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他什么都可以 说真的 见到你们很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else. Honestly, happy to see you guys, it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.39,0:36:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下来吃个饭吧 - 托尼 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, and table's set for six. - Tony, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.71,0:36:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很替你高兴 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm happy for you. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.80,0:36:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我们的第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.88,0:36:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我的第二次机会 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my second chance right here, cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.54,0:36:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't roll the dice again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.15,0:36:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来吃午饭吧 别聊这个话题就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't talk shop, you can stay for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.26,0:36:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他害怕了 - 他也没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's scared. - He's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.32,0:36:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们该怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I mean, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.53,0:36:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他 就这样放弃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need him. What, are we gonna stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.65,0:36:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但是要谨慎行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I wanna do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.82,0:36:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个聪明的帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need a really big brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.61,0:36:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,比他还聪明吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger than his?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.67,0:36:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都吃点吧 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I feel like I'm the only…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.02,0:37:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我一个人在吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}One eating here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.46,0:37:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点鸡蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.04,0:37:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.38,0:37:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能理解的事情多着呢 - 对 不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are confusing times. - Right. No, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.81,0:37:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是这个意思 - 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not what I meant. I… - No, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.54,0:37:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你开玩笑呢 我知道 这很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding! I know. It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.27,0:37:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我都开始穿衬衣了 - 对啊 怎么做到的 为什么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm wearing shirts now. - Yeah! How? why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.94,0:37:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前我们输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years ago we got our asses beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.88,0:37:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是对我来说更糟糕 因为我相当于输了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except it was worse for me. Because I lost twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.01,0:37:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是浩克输了 然后班纳输了 最后我们都输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, hulk lost. Then banner lost. Then, we all lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.18,0:37:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人怪你 布鲁斯 - 但我自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one blamed you, bruce. - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.65,0:37:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年来 我都把浩克当做\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years I've been treating the hulk like he's…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.44,0:37:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种病来治 想尽办法摆脱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of disease, something to get rid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.53,0:37:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是后来我把他看作一种解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I started looking at him as the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.68,0:37:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在伽马射线实验室呆了18个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen months in a gamma lab. I put…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.59,0:37:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,将智慧和力量融合在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brains and bron together…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.70,0:37:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看现在 两者完美结合在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now look at me. Best of both worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.82,0:37:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 浩克先生 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, mr. Hulk? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.83,0:37:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能和您合个影吗 - 当然可以了 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we get a photo? - 100%, little person.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.48,0:37:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 靠近点 能给我们拍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, step on up. You mind?
