Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.96,0:42:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.87,0:42:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…
