Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.47,0:45:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.00,0:45:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这可是大功告成啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see this as an absolute win.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.97,0:46:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉着个脸干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the long face?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.38,0:46:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜看 他变成了个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. He turned into a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.34,0:46:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还变成其他的了呢 是 你来这做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among other things, yeah. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.54,0:46:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是艾波罗悖论\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the epr paradox.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.12,0:46:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是朗在时间中穿梭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of pushing lang through time, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.25,0:46:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是时间在朗体内穿梭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might've wound up pushegardless, I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.42,0:46:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很复杂 也很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tricky. Dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.29,0:46:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有人警告你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody coulda cautiormir are laid in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.37,0:46:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你警告过 - 哦 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did. - Oh, did i?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.55,0:46:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地我来了 不管怎样 我修复了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god, I'm here. Regardless, I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个功能齐全的时空穿梭导航器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fully functioning time-space gps.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.47,0:46:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要讲和\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.22,0:46:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,仇恨太耗费精力了 我不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out, resentment is corrosive, and I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.92,0:46:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.49,0:46:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以再冒一次险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a shot at getting these stones, but i…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.48,0:46:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我要先告诉你对我来说什么最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta tell you my priority is to bring back…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.54,0:46:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们失去的拿回来 我当然也希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we lost? I hope, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.73,0:46:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会不计任何代价保护我现有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep what I found? I have to, at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.71,0:47:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 如果能不那么寻死当然就更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, maybe not die trying will be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.00,0:47:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.69,0:47:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 托尼 我不确定 - 为什么 他为你而造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tony, I don't know… - Why? he made it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.50,0:47:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外呢 我也得把它从车库拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, honestly I have to get it out the…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.49,0:47:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然摩根就拿去当滑板了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garage before morgang story, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.76,0:47:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.82,0:47:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能低调点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you keep that a little quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.15,0:47:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没给每个人都准备小礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't bring one fah, noobmaster69.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.97,0:47:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都齐了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are getting, the whole team, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.85,0:47:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在召集他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working on that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.52,0:48:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 兄弟 绿大个二在哪呢 - 厨房吧可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, humie! where's the green? - Kitchen. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.95,0:48:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不错啊这身 - 罗德 回来的时候小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's awesome. - Rhodey, careful on re-entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.28,0:48:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,着陆区有个傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an idiot in the landing zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.03,0:48:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.98,0:48:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么变正常大小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, regular-sized man?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.91,0:49:05.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到新阿斯加德 请减速慢行）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.72,0:49:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个跟什么金色宫殿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a step down from a golden palace…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.16,0:49:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法锤子啊差了几个档次啊好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}With some magic hammers and what that…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.09,0:49:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点同情心吧兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, have a little compassion,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.46,0:49:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们失去了阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pal. First, they lost Asgard…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.07,0:49:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又失去了一半的人口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then half the people. They're…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.31,0:49:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有个地方落脚已经很满足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just happy to have a home…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.60,0:49:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have come!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.33,0:49:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,女武神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valkyrie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.55,0:49:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 凶丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great to see you, angry girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.63,0:49:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你原来哪种模样都比现在这样都强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I liked you better either of the other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.82,0:49:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是火箭 - 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is rocket. - How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.34,0:49:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不会见你们的 - 这么糟糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He won't see you. - That bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.84,0:49:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只一个月见一次面 在他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only see him once a month, when he comes in for…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.52,0:49:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿补给的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.29,0:49:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这种糟糕啊 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's that bad. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.15,0:50:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.49,0:50:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西死在这了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woo! something died in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.25,0:50:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗 索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? thor?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.04,0:50:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是修有线电视的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here about the cable?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.35,0:50:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影频道两周前就不能看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cinemax ran out two weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.09,0:50:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,体育频道也不太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, sports were all kind of fuzzy…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.64,0:50:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.51,0:50:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们 哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys! oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.87,0:50:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 见到你们真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god! It's so good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.25,0:50:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来 你这个小淘气包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you little rascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.44,0:50:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我这样就挺好 我挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm good! I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.76,0:50:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用这么热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not necessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.76,0:50:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,浩克 你认识我朋友米克和克罗格 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk, you know my friends, miek, korg, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.59,0:50:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 兄弟们 - 嘿 好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, boys! - Hey, guys. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.24,0:50:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒在桶里 无线随便用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer's on the bucket. Feel free to log on to the wi-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.95,0:51:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接连 没有密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}No password, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.52,0:51:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔 他又来了 电视里那个小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, he's back. That kid on the tv…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.19,0:51:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才又说我蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just called me a dicky again…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.33,0:51:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菜鸟王 - 是的 菜鸟王69\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Noobmaster - Yeah, noobmaster69.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.76,0:51:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see this…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.24,0:51:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,菜鸟王 又是我 索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noobmaster. Hey, it's thor again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.09,0:51:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我是雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the God of Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.45,0:51:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 小朋友 如果你不立刻下线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, buddy. If you don't log off…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.74,0:51:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会飞到你家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This game immediately, I'm gonna fly…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.47,0:51:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over to your house, come down to…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.75,0:51:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏身的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}That basement you are hiding in…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.25,0:51:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯掉你的胳膊 然后塞到你屁屁里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip off your arms then shove them up your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.04,0:51:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right. Yes, go cry to…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.61,0:51:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找爸爸哭吧 你个胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father, you little weasel…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.77,0:51:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.56,0:51:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他再烦你 你就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know if he bothers you again, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.44,0:51:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.45,0:51:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们要喝点什么吗 你们喝什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you guys want a drink? what are you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.13,0:51:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有啤酒 龙舌兰 一应俱全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got beer, tequila, all sorts of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.38,0:51:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.09,0:51:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我很好 为什么这么问 我看起来不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm fine! why, don't you think I look all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.25,0:51:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去就像一滩化掉的冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like melted ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.48,0:51:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们是来干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's up or what…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.01,0:51:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help. There might be…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.60,0:51:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许有一个可以让一切恢复正常的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance we could fix everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.47,0:51:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 比如修好那台电视吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like the cable 'cause that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.62,0:51:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那玩意儿几周前就已经把我逼疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been driving me through weeks…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.29,0:52:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如灭霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like thanos.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.15,0:52:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许提这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.02,0:52:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 在这里我们都不提这个名字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yeah. We don't actually say that name in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.77,0:52:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take your hand off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.95,0:52:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know that…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.34,0:52:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙或许让你感到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy might scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.66,0:52:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I be? why would,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.83,0:52:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我会害怕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I be scary about that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.44,0:52:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我亲手杀了那个家伙 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who killed that guy, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.45,0:52:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁可以杀得了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else here killed that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.89,0:52:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.61,0:53:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗格 为什么你不提醒大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Korg, why don't you, tell everybody…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.89,0:53:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁砍下了灭霸的大脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who chopped thanos' big head off…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.84,0:53:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 暴风战斧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm… Stormbreaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.66,0:53:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁在使用暴风战斧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who's swinging stormbreaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.32,0:53:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的 你现在很纠结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. You're in a rough spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.56,0:53:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经也有过这样的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I've been there myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.89,0:53:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是谁帮助我走出来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know who helped me out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.03,0:53:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 是 娜塔莎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Is it… Natasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.08,0:53:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.23,0:53:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮助了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.27,0:53:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不去问问那些阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you ask the, asgardians down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.40,0:53:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的帮助对他们来说有没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much my help was worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.72,0:53:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他们已经离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones that are left, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.71,0:53:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许可以把他们带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.96,0:53:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,住口 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Just, stop…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.21,0:53:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得我在这里自怨自艾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think I'm down here wallowing in…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.47,0:53:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待着被救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own self-pity, waiting to be rescued…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.29,0:53:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没事好吗 我们挺好的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And saved. But I'm fine, Okay? we're fine, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.60,0:53:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们很好 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, all good here, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.48,0:53:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不管你们怎么说 我们都不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, whatever it is that you're offering, we're…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.45,0:53:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关心 完全不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not into it, don't care, couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.79,0:53:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.17,0:54:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.28,0:54:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船上有啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's beer on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.41,0:54:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.87,0:54:28.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东京）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.08,0:54:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.00,0:54:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在追明彦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.82,0:55:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.62,0:55:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和你无冤无仇
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.70,0:55:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们活下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.20,0:55:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个星球的人都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.54,0:55:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们遇到的是灭霸
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.54,0:55:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇到的不过是我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.80,0:55:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想再滥杀无辜了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.92,0:55:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们滥杀无辜
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.60,0:55:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.98,0:55:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.75,0:56:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.21,0:56:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我做什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.01,0:56:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.28,0:56:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.47,0:56:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.29,0:56:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.23,0:56:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither should you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.94,0:56:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.95,0:56:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管这个叫工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you're calling this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.69,0:56:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀再多人你的家人也回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing all these people isn't gonna bring your family back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.02,0:57:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.82,0:57:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance, maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.28,0:57:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.39,0:57:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.63,0:57:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要给我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.79,0:57:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我没能早些给你希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I couldn't give it to you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.48,0:57:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 让开点 勒保斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drifting left. On the side there, lebowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.36,0:57:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小贱箭 怎么样了 - 我叫火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ratchet, how's it going? - It's rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.01,0:57:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定点 你也就能在地球上算是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. You're only a genius on earth, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.91,0:57:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.52,0:58:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间穿梭服 不错呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time travel suit? not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.43,0:58:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨 嗨 轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Easy, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.19,0:58:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经很小心了 - 不 你是很粗重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm being very careful. - No, you're being very hulky.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.89,0:58:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很小心的 - 这些是皮姆粒子好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm being careful. - These are pym particles, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.49,0:58:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克·皮姆消失了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ever since hank pym got snapped…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.96,0:58:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就剩这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of existence, this is it…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.32,0:58:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共只有这么多 我们再也造不出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we have. We're not making any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.42,0:58:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯科特 冷静一点 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scott, calm down. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.36,0:58:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的量只够一人来回一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got enough for one round trip, each.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.73,0:58:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么多 不能重来 外加两次测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. No do-overs. Plus, two test runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.17,0:58:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One test run.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.26,0:58:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我还没做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm not ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.12,0:58:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.58,0:58:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.87,0:58:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特 你会因为时空转换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint, now you're gonna feel a little discombobulated…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.23,0:58:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而觉得有些混乱 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the chronoshift. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.61,0:58:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.16,0:58:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们可以 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can do this, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.87,0:58:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到过去 为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back in time, why don't we just…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.19,0:58:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到小时候的灭霸 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find baby thanos, you know? and…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.54,0:58:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 首先 这太残忍了 - 那可是灭霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- First of all, that's horrible. - It's thanos.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.71,0:58:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 时间不是这么运作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And secondly, time doesn't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.15,0:59:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变过去并不会改变未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changing the past doesn't change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.61,0:59:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we go back, we get the…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.59,0:59:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在灭霸拿到石头之前得到石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stones before Thanos gets them…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.32,0:59:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样灭霸就没法拿到石头 问题解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos doesn't have the stones. Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.10,0:59:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 这行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bingo. - That's not how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.08,0:59:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是这么听说的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, that's what I heard. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.21,0:59:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 谁这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By who? Who told you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.47,0:59:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际迷航 终结者 时空特警 两世奇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star trek, terminator, timecop, time after time,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.47,0:59:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时光怪客 - 时间的褶皱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quantum leap. - A wrinkle in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.80,0:59:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时光倒流七十年 - 热浴盆时光机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somewhere in time, - Hot tub time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.47,0:59:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿比阿弟大冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill and ted's excellent adventure. Basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.59,0:59:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上所有和时间旅行有关的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any movie that deals with time travel…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.58,0:59:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎胆龙威 不 这个不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die hard? No, it's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.36,0:59:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is known.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.42,0:59:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么大家都相信这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why everyone believes that…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.92,0:59:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not true…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.91,0:59:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一想 如果你穿越到了过去 那么过去就变成了你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it. If you travel to the past, that past becomes your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.53,0:59:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你之前的现在就成了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your former present becomes the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.68,0:59:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个过去不会被新的未来而改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which can't now be changed by your new future…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.44,0:59:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.37,0:59:41.65,Title,0,0,0,0,,所以《回到未来》只是一部胡编乱造的片子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So back to the future's a bunch of bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.23,0:59:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 克林特 倒数 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, clint. We're going in 3… 2… 1…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.96,1:01:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,库伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.25,1:01:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的耳机在哪 - 莱拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are my headphones? - Lila?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.35,1:01:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱拉 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lila! no!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.26,1:01:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.14,1:01:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.51,1:01:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Look at me. You Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.20,1:01:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.11,1:01:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.00,1:01:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.48,1:01:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们有回去的方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so the "how" works.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.97,1:01:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就要弄清楚时间和地点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we gotta figure out the "when, " and the "where."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.20,1:02:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房间里几乎所有人都\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost everyone in this room has had an encounter…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.97,1:02:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到过至少一颗无限宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}With at least one of the six infinity stones.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.77,1:02:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者可以把见过替换成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd subtitute the word "encounter" for?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.54,1:02:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点被某一颗弄死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have been killed by one of the six infinity stones.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.13,1:02:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我甚至都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't. I don't even know what…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.44,1:02:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you're talking about…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.01,1:02:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 我们的皮姆粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regardless, we only have enough pym particles…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.02,1:02:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只够每人来回一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one round trip each…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.92,1:02:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这些宝石曾出现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these stones have been in a lot of…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.68,1:02:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去许多不同的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different places through history…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.32,1:02:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的过去 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our history. So, not a lot of…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.84,1:02:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有很多合适的进入点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Convenient spots to drop in…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.71,1:02:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 意味着我们要挑选合适的位置 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which means we have to pick our targets. - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.32,1:02:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们从以太开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So. Let's start with the aether.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.63,1:02:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔 你知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.52,1:02:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睡着了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he asleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.86,1:02:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.84,1:02:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很确定他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.33,1:02:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪开始说起呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to start? umm…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.91,1:02:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 以太就不是一块宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The aether, first, is not a stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.78,1:02:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然以前有人说它长得像石头 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's called it a stone before. Ahem…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.23,1:02:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它更像是一团愤怒的泥巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more of a… an angry sludge, sort of thing. So…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.03,1:03:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别管它叫宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's gonna need to amend that, and stop saying that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.41,1:03:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's an interesting story, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.36,1:03:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年前 为了不让黑暗精灵们发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the aether. My grandfather, many years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.27,1:03:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祖父不得不把以太藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to hide the stone from the dark elves.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.88,1:03:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗精灵是很吓人的 而简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary beings. So jane, actually…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.28,1:03:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there she is. That's jane…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.09,1:03:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的前女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's… an old favor of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.26,1:03:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次她把手伸进以太里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… She stuck her hand inside a rock this one time…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.87,1:03:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后以太就附在她身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the aether stuck itself inside her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.08,1:03:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她变得很虚弱 我只好把她带回阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, she became very, very sick. So I had to take her to Asgard,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.19,1:03:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是我的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.41,1:03:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们努力想救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we had to try to fix her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.23,1:03:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我们还在热恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were dating at the time, you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.66,1:03:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将她介绍给我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to introduce her to my, my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.26,1:03:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我母亲死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's dead, and umm…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.44,1:03:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,简也不在我身边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know. Jane and I aren't even dating anymore, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.80,1:03:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事就是这样的 没有什么天长地久\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things happen though, you know. Nothing lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.26,1:03:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 世上唯一 - 你先坐下休息会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The only thing that… - Why don't you come sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.40,1:03:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没说完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.18,1:03:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上唯一永恒的东西就是变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing thatis permanent in life is impermanent?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.52,1:03:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.78,1:04:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃点啥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eggs? Breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.01,1:04:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想喝杯血腥玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'd like a bloody mary.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.93,1:04:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎尔说他是从魔拉格那偷走力量宝石的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quill said he stole the power stone from Morag.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.14,1:04:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔拉格是谁 - 魔拉格是个星球的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a person? - Morag's a planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.80,1:04:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎尔才是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quill was a person.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.03,1:04:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球 外太空的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a planet? like in outer space?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.45,1:04:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你 像只无忧无虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look. It's like a little puppy,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.02,1:04:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All happy there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.80,1:04:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去太空吗 你想去太空吗 小狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna go to space? you wanna go to space, puppy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.28,1:04:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能带你去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you to space.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.67,1:04:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 灭霸是在沃米尔找到的灵魂宝石 - 沃米尔又是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanos found the soul stone on Vormir. - What is Vormir?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.05,1:04:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个由亡灵支配的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dominion of death, at the very…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.41,1:04:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在宇宙中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Center of celes…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.71,1:04:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸就在那里杀了我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where… Thanos murdered my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.99,1:04:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noted.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.74,1:04:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个戴着时间宝石的家伙 - 奇异博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That time stone guy… - Doctor strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.86,1:04:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是哪方面的博士啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what kind of doctor was he?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.60,1:04:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,街头变戏法的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neurostuff meets rabbit from a hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.92,1:04:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他住的可是黄金地段呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice place in the village though.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.21,1:04:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 住在苏利文街吧 - 不 应该是布里克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Sullivan street. - Hmm… Bleecker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.77,1:04:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 他也住在纽约吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, he lived in New York?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.28,1:05:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他住多伦多吧 - 没有 是苏利文街\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. He lived in toronto. - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.08,1:05:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是布里克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bleecker.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.05,1:05:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果你选对了时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, if you pick the right year,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.90,1:05:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有三颗宝石同时出现在纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are three stones in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.00,1:05:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the front door!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.39,1:05:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们的计划是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.56,1:05:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,六颗宝石 分三队人马 只有一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six stones, three teams, one shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.10,1:05:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前 我们输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years ago, we lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.40,1:05:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.39,1:05:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost friends…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.68,1:05:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost family…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.36,1:05:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至失去了自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost a part of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.46,1:05:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我们有机会夺回一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we have a chance to take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.22,1:05:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们团队作战 只有一个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your teams, you know your missions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.56,1:05:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到宝石 并带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the stones, get them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.53,1:06:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人只能一次来回 不能犯错 也不能重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One round trip each. No mistakes. No do-overs.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.44,1:06:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去的是记忆里熟悉的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of us are going somewhere we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.57,1:06:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也可能会有突发情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't mean we should know what to expect.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.67,1:06:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全 互相照应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. Look out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.96,1:06:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的命运之战 我们一定会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the fight of our lives. And we're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.14,1:06:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.53,1:06:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.24,1:06:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还挺会的 - 要你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's pretty good at that. - Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.12,1:06:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你们听到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.48,1:06:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就开始吧 同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stroke those key, y'all agree?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.85,1:06:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪器启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tractors engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.37,1:06:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要保证把它完整带回来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise to bring that back in one piece, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.66,1:06:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好 行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.53,1:06:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会尽力的 - 你这保证也太敷衍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll do my best. - As promises go, that was pretty lame.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.78,1:06:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.76,1:07:15.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约 2012年）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.26,1:07:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we all have our assignments.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.91,1:07:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,两颗宝石在上城区 一颗在下城区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two stones uptown, one stone down,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.33,1:07:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,低调行事 注意时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay low. Keep an eye on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.75,1:08:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要也砸一下找找感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe smash a few things along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.65,1:08:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没必要 但试试也无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's gratuitous, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.35,1:08:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 地板刚打了蜡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be careful going that way. We just had the floors waxed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.73,1:08:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找奇异博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Doctor Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.13,1:08:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来早了五年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about… Five years too early.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.71,1:08:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂芬·斯特兰奇现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stephen Strange is currently performing…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.45,1:08:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在离这里二十个街区的地方做手术呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surgery about twenty blocks that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.20,1:08:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找他干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from him?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.30,1:08:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要那个 实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.03,1:08:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.66,1:09:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恐怕不行 - 对不起 我非拿不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm afraid not. - Sorry, but I wasn't asking.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.13,1:09:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不想和我过招的 - 确实 我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't wanna do this. - You're right. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.24,1:09:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要这颗宝石 而且我没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need that stone, and I don't have time to…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.30,1:09:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从头来说 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start over, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.05,1:09:22.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿斯加德 2013年）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.48,1:09:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给您的 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.32,1:09:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有裤子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have pants?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.85,1:09:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pants?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.85,1:09:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说 这个就可以 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind. It'll be fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.88,1:09:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是简\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.49,1:09:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Here's the deal, puppy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.70,1:09:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去引诱她然后我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna charm her and I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.84,1:09:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从后面给她来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna poke her with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.04,1:09:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把现实宝石抽出来后我们就溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And extract the reality stone and get gone, lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.24,1:09:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去去就来 那里有个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back, Okay? There's a…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.98,1:09:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒窖 就在这下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine cellar, which is down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.53,1:09:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲以前藏了很多酒在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father used to stash with a huge barrel of ale.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.32,1:09:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看能不能偷点来喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see if the cellar has a couple of…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.20,1:10:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你还没喝够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! aren't you drunk enough already.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.77,1:10:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去给洛基送点汤吧 - 好的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can bring some soup to Loki. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.46,1:10:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时髦大妈是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the fancy broad?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.32,1:10:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我母亲 她就是在今天死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my mother. She dies today.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.72,1:10:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这一天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That's today?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.91,1:10:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this. I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.91,1:10:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该在这的 我不该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't be here. I shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.80,1:10:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个主意太糟了 我要失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bad idea. I'm losing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.31,1:10:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 不 不 不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here. - No, no, no. I'm having…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.98,1:10:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喘不过气了 - 你过来 站这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm having a panic attack. - Come here. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.90,1:10:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有你失去了亲人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only one who lost people?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.83,1:10:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们在这干啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think we're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.62,1:10:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了唯一的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost the only family I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.91,1:10:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎尔 格鲁特 德拉克斯 有触角的姐们 他们都消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quill, Groot, Drax, the chick with the antenna, all gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.55,1:11:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想妈妈了 但她已经死了 再也回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I get you miss your mom, but she's gone, really gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.26,1:11:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有其他很多的人可以被救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are plenty of people who are only kinda gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.25,1:11:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can help them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.62,1:11:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你赶紧把脸收拾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is it too much to ask that you brush the crumbs on your beard,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.19,1:11:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个小妞搭个讪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make schmoopy talk to pretty pants,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.35,1:11:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后趁她不注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when she's not looking,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.92,1:11:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把现实宝石吸出来帮我救回我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck out the infinity stone and help me get my family back?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.89,1:11:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.41,1:11:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是在哭吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crying? - No…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.11,1:11:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我觉得自己失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I feel like I'm losing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.83,1:11:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作起来 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it together! You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.97,1:11:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.46,1:11:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.87,1:11:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我做得到 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I can. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.50,1:11:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做得到 我做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this. I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.99,1:11:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.87,1:11:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小可怜 她落单了 我们的机会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, heartbreaker. She's alone. This is our shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.47,1:11:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.11,1:11:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.00,1:12:00.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（魔拉格 2014年）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.45,1:12:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 把它放下来吧 蓝蓝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Bring it down, blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.09,1:12:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着那条线 就是那里 继续放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on that line. That's it. Down, down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.50,1:12:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能快点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can we hurry it up?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.74,1:12:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们赶时间啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, chop-chop. Come on. We're on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.96,1:12:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们净是帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that, is really helpful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.86,1:12:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意安全 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take care, Okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.10,1:12:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到石头赶紧回来 别搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that stone and come back. No messing around.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.77,1:12:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.59,1:12:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们速战速决吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get it done. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.87,1:12:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.03,1:12:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们互相照应啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys watch each other's six.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.85,1:12:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.91,1:12:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃米尔的坐标我已经输好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coordinates for Vormir are laid in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.94,1:12:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们会开飞船就没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}All they have to do is not fall out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.99,1:12:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿离布达佩斯也就十万八千里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a long way from Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.08,1:13:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, uhh…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.75,1:13:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要在这坐等那个叫奎尔的出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wait around for this Quill guy to show up and…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.42,1:13:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让他带我们去能量宝石就好 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he leads us to the power stone, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.14,1:13:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们埋伏起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.67,1:13:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,2014年要找宝石的可不止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not the only ones in 2014 looking for the stones.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.85,1:13:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 你刚刚是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, what are you talking about right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.41,1:13:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁在找这些宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else is looking for these stones?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.37,1:13:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲 我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father, my sister…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.76,1:13:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有我 - 还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And me. - And you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.05,1:13:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这时候在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.41,1:14:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不客气 - 我可没求你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're welcome. - I didn't ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.46,1:14:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而给你救场的总是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, you always need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.19,1:14:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.36,1:14:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 父亲叫我们回飞船上 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Father wants us back on the ship. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.76,1:14:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现了一颗无限宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's found an infinity stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.12,1:14:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪 - 一个叫魔拉格的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - On a planet called Morag.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.14,1:14:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲的计划终于启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father's plan is finally in motion.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.22,1:14:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是六分之一 星云 - 但这是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One stone isn't six, nebula. - It's a start.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.05,1:14:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他集齐全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he gets all of them…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.51,1:14:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗南找到了力量宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronan's located the power stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.30,1:14:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要派你们去他的飞船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dispatching you to his ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.32,1:14:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会不情愿的 - 敢反抗就要他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He won't like that. - His alternative is death, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.18,1:14:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗南的执念蒙蔽了他的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronan's obsession clouds his judgement.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.58,1:15:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会让您失望的 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not fail you, father.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.53,1:15:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.82,1:15:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.72,1:15:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,您会为我骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make you proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.94,1:15:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就只需要等着这个叫奎尔的人出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just, wait around for this quill guy to show up,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.40,1:15:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他带着我们去找力量宝石 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he leads us to the power stone, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.12,1:15:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,先埋伏好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.57,1:15:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,2014年要找宝石的可不止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not the only ones in 2014 looking for the stones.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.05,1:15:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was that? - I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.40,1:15:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头要裂开了 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head is splitting… I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.56,1:15:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的感官神经元在战斗中可能损坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her synaptic drive was probably damaged in battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.66,1:15:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去我的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her to my ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.60,1:16:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,得快点 队长 看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to hustle, cap. Things look like…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.98,1:16:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要收尾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just about to…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.20,1:16:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我正去电梯那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. I'm approaching the elevator now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.60,1:16:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's all the same to you…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.86,1:16:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在想喝那杯酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have that drink now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.70,1:16:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让他起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Get him on the…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.49,1:16:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后耍帅的机会多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay around and posing up later.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.19,1:16:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 记得帮我收拾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, if you're free to clean up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.16,1:16:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯先生 我差点忘了那件制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, mr. Rogers. I almost forgot that that suit…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.09,1:16:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,臀部设计真是不忍直视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did nothing for your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.83,1:16:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没人要你看 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one asked you look, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.39,1:16:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太荒谬了 - 我觉得你看上去挺好 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's ridiculous. - I think you look great, cap.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.32,1:16:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 这就是经典的美国翘臀\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned, that's america's ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.40,1:16:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖应该交给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gets the… Magic wand?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.32,1:16:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,神盾突击队来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike team's coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.39,1:16:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我们就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take that off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.37,1:16:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}By all means.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.57,1:17:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful with that thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.47,1:17:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然会被洗脑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you wanna mind erased.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.19,1:17:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可不怎么好玩 - 我们会小心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not in a fun way. - We promise to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.39,1:17:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些人是谁 - 他们是神盾局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are these guys? - They are shield…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.21,1:17:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是九头蛇 但我们当时还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually hydra. But, we didn't know that yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.26,1:17:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 你们不知道 他们一看就是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, you didn't? I mean… They look like bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.20,1:17:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得小 话可不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're small, but you're talking loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.09,1:17:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索救援由我来指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way down to coordinate search and rescue.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.72,1:17:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索救援由我来指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way down to coordinate search and rescue!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.03,1:17:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你们怎么会认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, honestly! how do you think you'll be…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.67,1:17:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.14,1:17:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 上吧 小家伙 我们要的宝石就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're up, little buddy. There's our stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.41,1:17:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把我弹出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Flick me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.92,1:17:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 喂 喂 - 嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! whoa, whoa. - Hey! buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.68,1:17:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干吗 已经超重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? Maximum occupancy has been reached.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.44,1:17:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走楼梯去 - 对 别进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take the stairs! - Yeah. Stop. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.74,1:18:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌楼梯 讨厌楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate the stairs. Hate the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.07,1:18:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 队长 权杖在电梯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, cap. I got our scepter in the…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.14,1:18:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚过十八层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevator just passing the 18th floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.56,1:18:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.26,1:18:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去大厅吧 - 好 大厅见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Head to the lobby. - Alright. I'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.62,1:18:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,证物到手 正要与李斯特博士汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidence secure. We're in route to dr. List.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.19,1:18:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没有任何阻碍 部长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No hitches at all, mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.85,1:18:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 你不是去指挥搜救了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain. I thought you were coordinating search and rescue?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.91,1:18:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.08,1:18:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, cap.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.51,1:18:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,朗姆洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumlow.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.20,1:18:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚接到部长电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a call from the secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.33,1:18:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在由我来接手权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be running the scepter.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.33,1:18:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir? I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.20,1:18:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到线报 有人要偷走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got word there may be an attempt to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.24,1:18:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, cap.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.99,1:19:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把权杖交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't give you the scepter.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.92,1:19:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给局长打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to call the director.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.80,1:19:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题的 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ok, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.90,1:19:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,九头蛇万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hail hydra.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.36,1:19:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many stairs!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.02,1:19:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拇指姑娘 能听见吗 我看到目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumbelina, do you copy? I've got eyes on the prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.82,1:19:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该上场了 - 已经出动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is go-time. - Bombs away.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.88,1:19:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用了什么香体喷雾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is, is that axe body spray?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.89,1:19:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我抽屉里放了一个以备不时之需\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I had a can just for emergencies. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.60,1:20:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能不能集中精神 - 我要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we focus, please? - I'm going inside you. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.92,1:20:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask you where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.86,1:20:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吃中饭 回阿斯加德 抱歉 你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lunch and then asgard. I'm sorry, you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.46,1:20:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大·皮尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexander pierce.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.45,1:20:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克·弗瑞的顶头上司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the man of the folks of Nick Fury.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.00,1:20:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我部长先生就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends call me Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.47,1:20:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得把犯人移交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to ask you to turn that prisoner over to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.98,1:20:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基只能由奥丁亲自裁决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki will be answering to Odin himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.28,1:20:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's gonna answer to us…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.28,1:20:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁可以拿走其他的 我只要那个箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin can have what's left. and I'm gonna need that case.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.15,1:20:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去七十年里它一直是神盾局的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's been shield property for over 70 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.27,1:20:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把箱子给我 史塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over the case, stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.34,1:20:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 行动 精灵鼠小弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, move it, stuart little.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.74,1:20:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况有点失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are getting dict that was your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.08,1:20:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想争论现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna argue who's got the…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.18,1:20:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Higher authority here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.20,1:20:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会死掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise me you won't die?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.56,1:20:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会有一点心律失常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're only giving me a mild cardiac dysrythmia.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.80,1:20:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来可不像只有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound mild.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.37,1:20:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把箱子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.20,1:20:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的权力很大 我只是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you got a lotta pull. I'm just saying…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.90,1:20:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把箱子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Then give me the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.76,1:20:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手 朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, lang!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.55,1:20:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手松开 - 没时间了 拔掉插头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get your hands off! - Window's closing. Pull my pin!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.45,1:20:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.76,1:20:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史塔克 - 史塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stark? - Stark!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.12,1:20:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在抽搐 给他透透气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he's convulsing. Give him air!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.91,1:20:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医护人员 - 医护人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Medic! - Medic!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.01,1:21:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy need some help!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.33,1:21:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔克 是你胸前机器的问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark, you… Your chest machine?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.55,1:21:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe! breathe!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.43,1:21:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 在小巷等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job. Meet me in the alley.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.86,1:21:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna grab that cube.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.51,1:21:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stairs!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.91,1:21:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 史塔克 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine, stark. Stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.86,1:21:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要试一下 不知道有没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try something, Okay? I have no idea if it's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.26,1:21:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.16,1:21:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用了 真是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That worked a treat. That was so crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.54,1:21:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不知道能不能起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea if that was gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.42,1:21:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 箱子 - 箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The case… - The case. It's, uhh…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.31,1:21:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子呢 洛基呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the case? where's loki?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.79,1:21:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.23,1:21:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本来可以不用这样的 - 我们搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That wasn't supposed to happen, was it? - Oh, we blew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.23,1:21:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki!?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.73,1:21:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.91,1:21:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你找到魔方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you found that cube.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.69,1:22:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在逗我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you gotta be shitting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.87,1:22:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在十四楼找到洛基了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have eyes on loki. 14th floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.50,1:22:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.25,1:22:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't wanna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.98,1:22:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能打一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.13,1:22:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.27,1:23:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.46,1:23:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴基 还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucky… Is… alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.04,1:23:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.93,1:23:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是美国翘臀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is america's ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.17,1:23:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 拜托 - 抱歉 我帮不了你 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, please! - I'm sorry. I can't help you, bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.98,1:23:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我把时间宝石交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I give up the time stone to help…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.71,1:23:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮助你的现实 我的现实便会陷入危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reality, I'm dooming my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.60,1:23:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, I'm not sure…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.16,1:23:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学理论不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The science really support that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.98,1:24:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,无限宝石缔造了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infinity stones create what you…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.43,1:24:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所经历的时间流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experience as the flow of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.59,1:24:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走一颗宝石 时间便会分流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove one of the stones, and that flow splits.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.56,1:24:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做也许会帮助你的现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this may benefit your reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.21,1:24:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我这里的可就不一定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my new one not so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.66,1:24:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个新的现实分支里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this new branched reality, without our…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.44,1:24:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有对抗黑暗力量的主要武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief weapon against the power of darkness,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.12,1:24:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的世界会危在旦夕 成千上万的人将会受苦受难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our world will be overrun. Millions will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.02,1:24:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 博士 你的科学能阻止这一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, doctor, can your science prevent all that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.26,1:24:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 但我们会消除它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But we can erase it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.49,1:24:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我们用完宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because once we're done with the stones,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.31,1:24:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会把它们归还到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can return each one…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.39,1:24:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,被拿走的那个时间点 所以 从时间线上来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the moment it was taken. So, chronologically…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.75,1:24:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在原来的现实里 宝石从没离开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that reality…. It never left.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.46,1:24:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 可你却忽略了最重要的一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but you're leaving out the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.04,1:24:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要归还宝石 你必须活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to return the stones, you have to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.80,1:24:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的 我会的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will. I will. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.18,1:25:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能只为了一个保证就用我们的现实去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't risk this reality on a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.48,1:25:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,至上尊者的职责就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the duty, of the sorcerer…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.11,1:25:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护时间宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme to protect the time stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.95,1:25:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么斯特兰奇把它交出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why the hell did strange give it away?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.77,1:25:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 斯特兰奇 他交出了宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - Strange. He gave it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.33,1:25:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把宝石给了灭霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave it to thanos.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.04,1:25:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是自愿的吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Willingly? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.48,1:25:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 我也不知道 也许他错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - I have no idea. Maybe he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.24,1:25:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.57,1:26:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇是我们当中最优秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange was meant to be the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.56,1:26:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他这么做一定有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he must've done it for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.87,1:26:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恐怕是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.28,1:26:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.63,1:26:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠你了 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting on you, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.41,1:26:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都靠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.98,1:26:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,运行检查程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run diagnostics.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.13,1:26:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看她的记忆文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me her memory file.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.67,1:26:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人 记忆文件有点混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire, the file appears entangled.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.44,1:26:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是一段记忆 但不是她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a memory, but not hers.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.60,1:26:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有另外一个意识在共享她的神经网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another consciousnesssharing her network.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.08,1:27:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个星云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another Nebula.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.66,1:27:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.22,1:27:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个复制品的时间戳 来自九年后的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This duplicate carries a time stamp… from nine years in the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.52,1:27:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这另一个星云在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this other Nebula?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.57,1:27:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的星系里 在魔拉格上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our solar system. On Morag.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.04,1:27:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能接入她吗 - 可以 她们是互相连接的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you access her? - Yes. The two are linked.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.86,1:27:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个复制品的记忆里 搜索无限宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search the duplicate's memories, for Infinity Stones.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.69,1:27:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史上这些宝石曾出现在很多不同的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these stones have been in a lot of different places throughout history.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.30,1:27:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的历史上 所以 没有那么多地点可选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our history. So, not a lot of convenient spots to just drop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.00,1:27:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这意味着我们需要谨慎选择目标 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which means we have to pick our targets. - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.07,1:27:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂停影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze image.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.87,1:27:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrans.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.32,1:27:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avengers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.66,1:27:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,自命不凡的可怜虫 那个倒影是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unruly wretches. What's that reflection?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.75,1:27:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放大 乌木喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amplify this, Maw.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.12,1:28:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.36,1:28:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两个星云 - 不 是同一个星云\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two Nebulas. - No. The same Nebula.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.36,1:28:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自两个不同的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}From two different times.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.13,1:28:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,设置好去魔拉格的航线 继续扫描这个复制品的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set course for Morag. Scan the duplicate's memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.17,1:28:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看到一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.52,1:28:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 待会见 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ladies, I'll see you after. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.50,1:28:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么呢 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.31,1:28:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷偷摸摸的事还是让你弟弟来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're better off leaving the sneaking to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.11,1:28:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是正好在散步 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was simply just going for a walk, and uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.64,1:28:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿的这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.77,1:29:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直这么穿 这件是我的最爱之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wear this. This is one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.24,1:29:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with your eye?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.56,1:29:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我的眼睛 那是 你还记得哈罗金之战吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my eye. That's… You remember the Battle of Haroquin?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.98,1:29:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我被阔剑砍中了脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I got hit in the face with a broadsword?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.52,1:29:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不是我认识的那个索尔 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the Thor I know at all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.37,1:29:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.60,1:29:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在未来受了很多苦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future hasn't been kind to you, has it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.45,1:29:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没说我是从未来来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say I'm from the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.99,1:29:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 我是被女巫养大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was raised by witches, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.44,1:29:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不止用眼睛在看 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see with more than eyes, and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.84,1:29:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实 确实来自未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am totally, totally from the future!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.48,1:29:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.23,1:29:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的想和你说说话 - 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I really need to talk to you. - We can talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.29,1:30:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}His head was over there…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.78,1:30:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身体在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body over there…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.44,1:30:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是又有什么意义呢 已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the point. I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.73,1:30:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是站在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just standing there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.37,1:30:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是个拿着斧子的傻子 - 你才不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some idiot with an ax. - You're no idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.78,1:30:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是来到了这里吗 向阿斯加德最睿智的人求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here aren't you? Seeking counsel from the wisest person in Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.50,1:30:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想可以这么说 - 傻子 算不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess, yeah. - Idiot? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.42,1:30:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但失败是肯定的 - 这话就不太好听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A failure? Absolutely. - That's a little bit harsh.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.68,1:30:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know what that makes you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.71,1:30:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着和其他所有人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.82,1:30:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不应该和其他人一样 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to be like everyone else, am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.40,1:30:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人在追寻自己应该成为的样子时都会经历失败 索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone fails at who they are supposed to be, Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.30,1:30:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,衡量一个人 一个英雄的标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}The measure of a person, of a hero…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.64,1:30:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们最终接受并成就自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is how well they succeed at being who they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.92,1:31:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很想你 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really missed you, Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.50,1:31:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔 我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.89,1:31:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住那只兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.41,1:31:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 我有些事必须告诉你 - 不 儿子 不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma, I have to tell you something. - No, son. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.38,1:31:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里要拯救的是你的未来 不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here to repair your future, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.46,1:31:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这和你的未来有关 - 与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But this is about your future. - It's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.15,1:31:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.43,1:31:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定就是他母亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.84,1:31:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到东西了 我们得赶紧撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the thing. Come on, we got to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.76,1:31:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真想陪你多待一会 - 不 这已经是馈赠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish we had more time. - This was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.22,1:31:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去成就你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going to be the man you're meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.88,1:31:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 妈妈 - 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you, Mom. - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.53,1:31:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,多吃点沙拉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And eat a salad.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.35,1:31:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 我们该走了 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. We gotta go. - Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.39,1:31:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 二 - 不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three… Two… - No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.08,1:31:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh… What am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.23,1:32:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 有时候是要花点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sometimes it takes a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.67,1:32:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然配得上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.58,1:32:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.11,1:32:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.56,1:32:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个傻子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.49,1:33:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.48,1:33:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.78,1:33:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗贼的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tool of a thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.36,1:33:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时候是不是该有尖刺冒出来 上面挂着骷髅什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the part where spikes come out, with skeletons on the end and everything…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.12,1:33:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.25,1:33:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫力量宝石神庙的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you break into a place called the temple of the Power Stone,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.81,1:33:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会有很多陷阱 好吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be a bunch of booby traps… Okay. All right. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.68,1:34:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't always like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.37,1:34:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me either.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.96,1:34:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这样的身体对我们来说也有用 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we work with what we got, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.45,1:34:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,同步开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sync up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.68,1:34:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.. Two.. One…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.94,1:34:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀害了无数生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murdered trillions!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.72,1:34:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.73,1:34:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝石在哪里 - 没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are the stones? - Gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.20,1:34:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 化为原子了 - 你两天前才刚刚用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reduced to atoms. - You used them two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.05,1:34:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用宝石摧毁了宝石 几乎也要了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used the stones to destroy the stones. It nearly killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.49,1:34:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的使命完成了 注定如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the work is done. It always will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.22,1:35:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 就是天命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.24,1:35:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对他们做了什么 - 什么都没做 目前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do to them? - Nothing. Yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.53,1:35:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是要阻止此时此刻我要做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not trying to stop something I'm going to do in our time.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.52,1:35:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是要逆转那时候我已经完成的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to undo something I've already done in theirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.50,1:35:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stones…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.00,1:35:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全部找齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.45,1:35:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.78,1:35:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙的天平达到了平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tipped the cosmic scales to balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.79,1:35:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是您的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your future.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.77,1:35:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.92,1:35:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲什么都做得出来 但他从不说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father is many things. A liar is not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.84,1:35:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.84,1:35:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我对你太苛刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I treated you too harshly…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.69,1:35:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完成了我的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, is destiny fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.88,1:36:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人 你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire, your Daughter…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.94,1:36:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.52,1:36:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个背叛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.76,1:36:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我 那不是 我永远不能 我永远不会背叛您 永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not me. It's not. I could never… I would never betray you. Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.59,1:36:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.45,1:36:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上就有机会证明这一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll have the chance to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.03,1:36:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.85,1:36:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.61,1:36:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴顿 巴顿 快接听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barton? Barton, come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.20,1:36:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫 快接听 我们有麻烦了 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romanoff? Come in, we have a problem. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.03,1:36:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快接听 我们有麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, we have a prob….
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.54,1:36:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.65,1:36:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.64,1:37:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.28,1:37:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, buddy. We got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.51,1:37:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.19,1:37:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们现在要做什么 - 让我缓缓 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, what are we gonna do now? - You know what, give me a break, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.42,1:37:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚被浩克砸中了脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got hit in the head with a Hulk.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.37,1:37:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我们只有一次机会 那就是我们的唯一机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that we had one shot. This, this was our shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.38,1:37:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用了 就没得用了 凑不齐就白费 凑不齐就白费\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shot it. It's shot. Six stones or nothing. Six stones or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.49,1:37:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在重复自己的话 你知道吗 你在重复你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're repeating yourself, you know that? You're repeating yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.16,1:37:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才在重复自己的话 你才在重复自己的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're repeating yourself. You're repeating yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.29,1:37:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.25,1:37:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不想搞时空劫持 你后来接受了时空劫持\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never wanted a time heist, you went on board with the time heist…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.56,1:37:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我搞砸了 - 你最后毁了时空劫持\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I dropped the ball. - You ruined the time heist.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.60,1:37:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怪我吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that what I did? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.71,1:37:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么办法能搞到宇宙魔方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any other options with the Tesseract?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.53,1:37:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了 没其他办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. There's no other options.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.40,1:37:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有重来的机会 我们哪里也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no do-overs. We're not going anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.60,1:37:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每人只有一管粒子 一管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have one particle left. Each.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.01,1:37:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 明白吗 我们要是用了 再见 你们别想回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, alright? We use that… Bye, bye. You're not going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.80,1:37:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果我们不尝试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well if we don't try…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.06,1:37:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那所有人也都回不了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then no one else is going home, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.79,1:37:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.41,1:37:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个办法 能重新拿到宇宙魔方并且拿到新的粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another way. To retake the Tesseract and acquire new particles.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.45,1:37:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在回忆的小路上多走几步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll stroll down memory lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.19,1:37:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,新泽西军事基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military Installation…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.14,1:38:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候可以在那儿同时找到这两样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}When were they both there?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.36,1:38:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们同时在那里是在 我隐约记得一个时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were there at a… I've a vaguely exact idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.64,1:38:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多隐约\N{\fnArial\fs30}How vague?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.36,1:38:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说什么 我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.73,1:38:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我确定它们在那里 - 他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know for a fact they were there… - Who's they?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.40,1:38:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去做什么 - 我也知道我为什么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we doing? - And I know how I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.87,1:38:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 怎么了 你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, what's up? what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.04,1:38:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去我们要即兴发挥一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like we're improvising.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.61,1:38:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 我们要即兴发挥什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - What are we improvising?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.36,1:38:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯考特 把这个带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, get this back to the compound.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.43,1:38:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.48,1:38:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,新泽西有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in new jersey?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.43,1:38:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 04-04 - 07\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 0-4, 0-4… - Uhh, 0-7.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.53,1:38:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 07 - 打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 0-7. - Excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.53,1:38:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,1970\N{\fnArial\fs30}1-9-7-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.48,1:38:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 - 队长 队长 史蒂夫 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - Cap. Captain. Steve, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.11,1:38:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国 罗杰斯 听着 如果你们这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}America. Rogers. Look, if you do this,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.26,1:38:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后没有成功 你们就回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this doesn't work, you're not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.01,1:38:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的鼓舞 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the pep talk, pissant.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.72,1:38:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust me?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.79,1:38:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.28,1:38:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.33,1:38:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.87,1:39:00.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新泽西州 1970年）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.84,1:39:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.34,1:39:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,床上去吧 不要打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make love, not war!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.80,1:39:14.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国军队）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.85,1:39:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不是真的出生在这儿的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, you weren't actually born here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.83,1:39:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造我的想法诞生在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea of me was.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.77,1:39:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 假设你是神盾局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, imagine you're shield, running a…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.38,1:39:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想组织一个法西斯情报机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quasi-fascistic intelligence organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.40,1:39:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把它藏在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you hide it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.13,1:39:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,众目睽睽之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.21,1:40:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你任务顺利 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck on your mission, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.69,1:40:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也祝你 项目成功 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck on your project, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.32,1:40:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是新来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're new here?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.17,1:40:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.66,1:40:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.80,1:40:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,重返赛场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.26,1:40:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尼姆 你在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arnim, you in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.16,1:40:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尼姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arnim?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.68,1:41:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.52,1:41:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,门在这边 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door's this way, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.26,1:41:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.69,1:41:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找佐拉博士 你看到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for dr. Zola. Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.38,1:41:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没有 佐拉博士 我谁也没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, dr. Zol… No, I haven't seen a soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.34,1:41:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.57,1:41:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.56,1:41:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. I'm, a…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.85,1:41:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是麻省理工学院来的访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visitor from mit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.52,1:41:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 麻省理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Mit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.92,1:41:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a name?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.51,1:41:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.50,1:41:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是很好记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that'll be easy to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.16,1:41:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.56,1:41:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,波兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}potts.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.70,1:41:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我是霍华德 史塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm howard stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.97,1:41:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.22,1:41:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,握个手 别使劲扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Now, don't pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.31,1:41:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.14,1:41:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,波兹 你看上去脸色很苍白啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look a little green around the gills there, potts.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.51,1:41:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 就是累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Just, long hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.84,1:41:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想出去呼吸点新鲜空气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna get some air?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.08,1:41:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波兹 你在听吗 - 好 那再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, potts. - Yeah. That would be swell.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.72,1:41:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边走 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That way. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.44,1:41:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了你的手提箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need your briefcase?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.46,1:42:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是那些披头士吧 波兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not one of those beatles, are ya, potts?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.88,1:42:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 皮姆博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Dr. Pym?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.86,1:42:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你没有打错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be the number that you called. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.38,1:42:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史蒂夫队长 货运队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is capt. Stevens from shipping.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.80,1:42:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们这儿有个您的包裹 - 带上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have a package for you. - Bring it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.45,1:42:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是我们拿不上去 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the thing, sir. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.81,1:42:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我糊涂了 这不是你们的工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm confused. I thought that was your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.49,1:42:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 只是 先生 这个盒子在发光 而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's just… Sir, the box is glowing and,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.65,1:42:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我们的一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, some of our mail…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.91,1:42:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,邮递员不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys aren't feeling that great…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.64,1:42:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有打开箱子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't open it, did they?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.16,1:42:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他们打开了 您最好快点下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they did. You better get down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.48,1:42:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 让一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.05,1:43:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 鲜花和泡菜罐头 你今晚有约吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, flowers and sauerkraut. You got a big date tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.55,1:43:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife's expecting.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.56,1:43:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我最近工作得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh… Too much time in the office.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.19,1:43:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 谢谢 帮我拿一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Congratulations. - Thanks. Hold this, ?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.43,1:43:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.92,1:43:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怀孕多久了 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How far along is she? - I don't know… Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.88,1:43:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在处于\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's at the point where she can't…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.10,1:43:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,受不了我咀嚼声的阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand the sound of my chewing…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.81,1:43:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我又要在储藏室吃晚饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll be eating dinner in the pantry again.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.98,1:43:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个小女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.28,1:43:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl would be nice. Less of a chance…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.67,1:43:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我的机率要小些\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd turn out exact like me…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.56,1:43:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd be so awful about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.05,1:43:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个人说好听点就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say that the greater good has rarely outweighed…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.40,1:43:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,相对于集体利益更看重个人利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own self-interests.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.45,1:43:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前从没有见过这两个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've never seen these 2 men before?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.85,1:43:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我只是直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I've got ander all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.92,1:43:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们很可疑 - 你能描述一下他们的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The 2 of them looked fishy. - Can you describe them?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.72,1:43:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 一个留着嬉皮士风格的胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one of them had a hippie beard.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.37,1:43:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嬉皮士 像比吉斯还是蒙哥杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hippie? Like bee gees or Mungo Jerry…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.13,1:43:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是蒙哥杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely mungo jerry.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.38,1:43:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是切斯勒 我需要所有人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is chesler. I need every available mps…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.26,1:43:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往地下六层 我们可能被入侵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On sub-level 6. We have a potential breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.48,1:44:16.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玛格丽特·卡特 局长）
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.35,1:45:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你起好名字了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where are you at with names?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.19,1:45:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果是个男孩 我妻子想叫他艾蒙佐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it's a boy, my wife likes almanzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.41,1:45:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该趁着还有时间再仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might wanna let that stew while you got time.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.42,1:45:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.63,1:45:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你的孩子出生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your kid was born…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.29,1:45:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你紧张吗 - 非常紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were you nervous? - Wildly. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.31,1:45:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能当好父亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you feel qualified?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.84,1:45:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you had any idea how to…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.86,1:45:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么去正确地做这件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Successfully operate that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.64,1:45:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真的把每件事都考虑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I literally pieced it together as I went along,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.64,1:45:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了一遍我父亲都做过些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about what my dad did, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.57,1:45:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸 从来都\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old man, he never met a problem…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.03,1:45:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用皮带解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't solve with a belt…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.43,1:45:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从前也觉得我父亲对我很严厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought my dad was tough on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.55,1:45:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在回想起来 我只\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, looking back, I just…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.08,1:45:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得那些好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the good…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.51,1:45:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的确字字珠玑 - 是吗 比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He did drop the odd pearl. - Yeah? like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.66,1:45:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,寸金难买寸光阴\N{\fnArial\fs30}"no amount of money ever bought a second of time."
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.50,1:45:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.06,1:45:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did his best.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.76,1:45:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说实话吧 虽然这孩子还没有出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you. That kid's not even here yet…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.80,1:45:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我愿意为他做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, there's nothing I wouldn't do for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.19,1:46:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴遇见你 波兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to meet you, potts.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.77,1:46:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, howard…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.65,1:46:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.96,1:46:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for everything…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.87,1:46:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对国家贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've done for this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.12,1:46:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jarvis.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.84,1:46:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前见过这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we ever met that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.73,1:46:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,您见过的人太多了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meet a lot of people, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.78,1:46:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems very familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.47,1:46:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过胡子怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird beard, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.08,1:46:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你太弱了 - 我就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're weak. - I'm you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.20,1:47:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以阻止这一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.44,1:47:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.44,1:47:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到未来的发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see what happens in the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.73,1:47:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸找到了灵魂宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos finds the soul stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.64,1:47:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道他是怎么找到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know how he does that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.93,1:47:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道 他对你做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know, what he does to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.86,1:47:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.28,1:47:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disgust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.16,1:47:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也不是完全没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, that doesn't mean you're useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.99,1:48:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看上去如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.80,1:48:16.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（沃弥尔 2014年）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.10,1:48:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.16,1:48:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是任务紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under different circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.44,1:48:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿真的是个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would be totally awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.11,1:48:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜浣熊他们不用爬山\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet the raccoon didn't have to climb a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.68,1:48:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格地说 他不是浣熊 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, he's not a raccoon, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.72,1:48:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他的 反正他也吃垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. He eats garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.58,1:48:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.91,1:48:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 伊凡之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, daughter of ivan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.57,1:48:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特 伊迪丝之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint, son of edith.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.75,1:49:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.75,1:49:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是向导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider me a guide.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.37,1:49:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的向导 所有想要找到灵魂宝石的人的向导\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you, and to all who seek the soul stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.33,1:49:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那你告诉我们它在哪 我们拿了就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You tell us where it is. Then we'll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.23,1:49:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这么简单就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only it were that easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.76,1:49:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要找的 就在你们面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you seek lies in front of you…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.64,1:49:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的恐惧也会随它而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}as does what you fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.08,1:49:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stone is down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.67,1:49:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们中的一个来说是宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.91,1:49:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the other…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.28,1:49:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要得到宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to take the stone,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.36,1:49:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须舍弃你爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must lose that which you love…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.74,1:50:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}An everlasting exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.98,1:50:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂 才能换灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soul, for a soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.70,1:50:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.28,1:50:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.20,1:50:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准全都是他胡扯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's making this shit up.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.67,1:50:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.60,1:50:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 就因为他知道你爸的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, 'cause he knows your daddy's name?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.33,1:50:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道我爸的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.67,1:50:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭霸从这里离开的时候带走了宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanos left here with the stone…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.72,1:50:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没带走他的女儿 这可不是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without his daughter. It's not a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.80,1:50:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.09,1:50:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.40,1:50:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.25,1:50:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不拿到宝石 亿万人就不可能活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get that stone, billions of people stay dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.95,1:50:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.05,1:51:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我想我们都知道谁该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I guess we both know who it's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.92,1:51:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.69,1:51:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.09,1:51:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩的人选可能不太一样 娜塔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We mean different people here, Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.72,1:51:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去五年 我只有一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last five years, I've been trying to do one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.75,1:51:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.06,1:51:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切就是为了把所有人带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all it's been about bringing everybody back.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.25,1:51:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说什么漂亮话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't you get all decent on me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.61,1:51:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我想这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think I wanna do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.17,1:51:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在拯救你的性命 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save your life, your idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.36,1:51:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你这么做 因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, I don't want you to, because i…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.32,1:51:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 你知道我曾经犯了什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natasha, you know what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.32,1:51:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我变成了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I've become.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.01,1:51:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不用过错来评判一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't judge people on their worst mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.78,1:51:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.23,1:51:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都没有这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.63,1:52:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真拿你没办法 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a pain in my ass, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.88,1:52:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.07,1:52:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.80,1:52:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我的家人 我爱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell my family I love them.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.70,1:52:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell them yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.22,1:53:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.53,1:53:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.43,1:53:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.48,1:53:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.66,1:53:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.66,1:53:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.83,1:53:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.37,1:55:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到所有宝石了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get them all?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.60,1:55:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们居然成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You telling me this'll actually work?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.32,1:55:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林特 娜塔莎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clint, where's nat?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.86,1:56:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we know if she had family?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.91,1:56:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Us.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.52,1:56:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.99,1:56:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是问了他一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just asked him a question…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.25,1:56:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但你说的好像她死了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're acting like she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.44,1:56:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们要当作她死了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we acting like she's dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.52,1:56:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有宝石 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the stones, right? as long as we have…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.76,1:56:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们有宝石 我们就能把她带回来 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stones, cap, we can bring her back, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.94,1:56:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别废话了 我们是复仇者 打起精神来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stop this shit. We're the avengers, get it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.26,1:56:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能让她复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.45,1:56:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什 什么 - 这是不可逆转的 不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wha… What? - It can't be undone. It can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.60,1:56:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. No offense,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.01,1:56:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你只是一个地球人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're a very earthly being.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.94,1:56:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说的是宇宙魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about space magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.68,1:56:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能似乎太绝对了 你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "can't" seems very definitive, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.80,1:56:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这件事我没有发言权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know that I'm way outside my paygrade here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.74,1:56:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她依然回不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she still isn't here, is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.57,1:56:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不这么觉得 - 这一切是不可逆转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, that's my point. - It can't be undone.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.72,1:56:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少那个飘着的红色的家伙是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that's at least what the red floating guy had to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.20,1:56:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以去问他 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you wanna go talk to him? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.91,1:56:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上你的锤子 飞过去问他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go grab your hammer, and you go fly and you talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.28,1:57:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,本该是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.82,1:57:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为了那块该死的石头牺牲了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sacrificed her life for that goddamned stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.29,1:57:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她用命换来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She put her life on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.61,1:57:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.82,1:57:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能辜负她 一定不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to make it worth it. We have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.74,1:57:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会辜负她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.95,1:57:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.75,1:57:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 手套准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. The glove's ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.19,1:58:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 谁来打那个要命的响指呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, who's gonna snap their freaking fingers?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.07,1:58:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.61,1:58:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - It's Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.60,1:58:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 停 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no. Stop. Stop. - Hey, hey…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.50,1:58:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.56,1:58:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没决定谁来戴这个手套呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't decided who's gonna put that on yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.18,1:58:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思你说什么 难道我们就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What, were you just sitting…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.71,1:58:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在这儿等良辰吉日吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around waiting for the right opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.35,1:58:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们应该讨论一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should at least discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.54,1:58:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们就这样坐在这儿 盯着那个玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, us sitting here staring at…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.10,1:58:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不可能把所有人救回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing is not gonna bring everybody back…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.41,1:58:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是最强的复仇者 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the strongest avenger, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.91,1:58:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这个责任必须落在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this responsibility falls on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.62,1:58:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的使命 - 不是 - 别说了 就让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my duty. - It's not that… - It's… Stop it! just let me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.43,1:58:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧 就让我做点好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me do it. Just let me do something good.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.94,1:58:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做点正确的事 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something great. - Look…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.03,1:58:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让你来 不仅是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just the fact that that glove is channeling…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.87,1:58:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个手套聚集着惊天动地的能量 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough energy to light up a continent, I'm telling you…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.56,1:58:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在的状态不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in no condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.62,1:58:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我血液里流淌的是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think is coursing through my veins right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.00,1:58:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶酪酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheez whiz?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.56,1:58:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是闪电啊 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lightning. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.22,1:58:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电也帮不了你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning won't help you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.62,1:58:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须得是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.55,1:58:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也看见宝石让灭霸变成了那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what those stones did to Thanos.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.00,1:58:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个响指几乎要了他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It almost killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.95,1:59:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都扛不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you could survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.29,1:59:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么确定你能扛得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know you will?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.24,1:59:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定 但是宝石的辐射主要是伽玛射线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't. But the radiation's mostly gamma.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.66,1:59:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.23,1:59:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我存在的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was made for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.76,1:59:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to go, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.49,1:59:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.10,1:59:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住五年前所有被灭霸的响指变消失了的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember everyone thanos snapped away five years ago…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.03,1:59:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带回到现在 就是今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just bringing them back to now, today.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.55,1:59:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要改变过去五年内任何的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't change anything from the last five years.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.24,1:59:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.27,2:00:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期五 启动防御程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friday, do me a favor and activate protocol 8.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.95,2:00:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, boss.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.80,2:00:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody comes home.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.90,2:00:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摘下来 快摘下来 - 不 等等 布鲁斯 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it off. Take it off! - No, wait. Bruce, are you Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.88,2:00:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句话 班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, banner.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.41,2:00:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Okay. I'm Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.53,2:01:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.37,2:01:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move him.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.91,2:01:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了吗 - 不知道 好了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did it work? - Worth a shot. It's over. It's Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.12,2:02:20.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（劳拉 来电）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.52,2:02:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 - 克林特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey. - Clint…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.64,2:02:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.48,2:02:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.67,2:02:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it worked!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.73,2:03:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喘不过气了 喘不过气了 喘不过气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't breathe. I can't breathe! I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.74,2:03:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,战甲解除 战甲解除 战甲解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canopy. Canopy. Canopy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.07,2:03:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德 火箭 快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodey, rocket, get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.97,2:03:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我出去 救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out! Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.08,2:03:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.17,2:03:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodey!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.52,2:03:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫救援 呼叫救援 有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday, mayday! does anybody copy?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.37,2:04:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在底层 这里进水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the lower here. It's flooding.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.87,2:04:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我们快被淹死了 有人吗 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We're drowning! does anybody copy? mayday!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.98,2:04:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我在 我在 能听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I'm here! I'm here, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.50,2:04:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.24,2:05:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughter.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.58,2:05:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.53,2:05:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这里就是未来 做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is the future. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.32,2:05:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 父亲 他们一点也没有怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, father. They suspected nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.88,2:05:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arrogant never do.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.34,2:05:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.38,2:05:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到宝石 带回来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the stones. Bring them to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.10,2:05:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,您要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.93,2:05:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.14,2:06:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.77,2:06:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在未来 我们之间发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future, what happens to you and me?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.43,2:06:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.63,2:06:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several times.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.50,2:06:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是最后 我们成了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But eventually, we become friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.03,2:06:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成了姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We become sisters.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.21,2:06:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.46,2:06:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.58,2:06:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 兄弟 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.39,2:06:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my man.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.83,2:06:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再把这个丢了 我就不给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lose this again, I'm keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.40,2:07:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.78,2:07:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞时间 时间也会搞你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We messed with time. It tends to mess back.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.00,2:07:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上就懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.94,2:07:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he been doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.08,2:07:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.45,2:07:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the stones?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.58,2:07:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该还在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost somewhere under all this.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.93,2:07:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之他还没得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is he doesn't have them.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.31,2:07:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就保证让他一直拿不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.01,2:07:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道这是个陷阱吧 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know it's a trap, right? - Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.05,2:07:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't much care.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.38,2:07:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.35,2:07:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们达成一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as long as we're all in agreement.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.64,2:08:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次就让我们彻底了结他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kill him properly this time.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.95,2:08:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接受不了失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could not live with your own failure.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.37,2:08:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did that bring you?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.13,2:08:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是要面对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.64,2:08:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为毁掉半数生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought by eliminating half of life,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.87,2:08:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一半会繁荣发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other half would thrive.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.76,2:08:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果证明 那根本不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've shown me, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.72,2:08:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有人还记得过往\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as long as there are those that remember what was,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.23,2:08:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就总会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will always be those that…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.00,2:08:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些无法接受改变的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are unable to accept what can be.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.21,2:08:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会一直反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will resist.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.89,2:08:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们就是那么固执\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. We're all kinds of stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.64,2:08:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thankful.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.40,2:09:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为此时 我知道我必须做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because now, I know what I must do.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.01,2:09:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要将这个宇宙化为尘埃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shred this universe down to its last atom.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.15,2:09:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.88,2:09:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你们帮我收集的宝石 创造全新的宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the stones you've collected for me, create a new one.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.46,2:09:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teeming with life,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.72,2:09:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不念落失\N{\fnArial\fs30}That knows not what it has lost…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.66,2:09:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只认所得的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only what it is been given.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.16,2:09:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个懂得感恩的宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A grateful universe.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.26,2:09:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,由鲜血建立的宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born out of blood.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.64,2:09:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们无从得知\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.24,2:09:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们活不到那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you won't be alive to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.09,2:09:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面见了兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you on the other side, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.75,2:09:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.85,2:10:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.57,2:10:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.32,2:10:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 我拿到宝石了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father. I have the stones.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.56,2:10:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.92,2:10:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.07,2:11:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要背叛我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're betraying us?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.57,2:11:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.54,2:11:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am… This.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.35,2:11:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.76,2:11:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见我们变成什么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen what we become.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.58,2:11:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,星云 听她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nebula, listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:28.47,2:11:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can change.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.60,2:11:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't let me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:38.91,2:11:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.21,2:12:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 索尔 给我来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thor. Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.01,2:12:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.87,2:13:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.89,2:14:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这些年的征服\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all my years of conquest…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.62,2:14:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.46,2:14:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slaughter…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.57,2:14:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was never personal.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.70,2:14:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在要让你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll tell you now…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.73,2:14:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么对付你们这个顽固不化\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm about to do to your stubborn,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.25,2:14:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人烦厌 微不足道的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annoying little planet…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.68,2:15:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会非常 非常享受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna enjoy it. Very, very much.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.64,2:16:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 能听见我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.20,2:16:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 我是山姆 能听见我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap, It's sam. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.49,2:16:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your left.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.36,2:17:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,必胜
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.89,2:17:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,必胜
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.50,2:17:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,必胜
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.48,2:17:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that everyone?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:52.10,2:17:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你还嫌不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you wanted more?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:20.86,2:18:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avengers…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.81,2:18:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}assemble.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.16,2:19:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 那个给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.28,2:19:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿小的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the little one.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.51,2:19:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:44.46,2:19:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy cow.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.55,2:19:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不相信发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not believe what's been going on.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.88,2:19:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得我们在太空里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember we were on space…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.61,2:19:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我化成灰了 我肯定昏过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got all dusty? I must've passed out,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.02,2:19:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒来后你就就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I woke up, you were gone.
